s/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.poster.avif?t=1755494502\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.webm?t=1755494502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/304884db1b4ce0e79739f038eb58ef99.mp4?t=1755494502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the blunt, sarcastic remarks of the narrator and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.poster.avif?t=1755494502\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.webm?t=1755494502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/ea527309de8e46c05c890e0ba6ed77a4.mp4?t=1755494502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
